#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:2
msgid "Server Management"
msgstr "服务端管理"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``wireguard server`` command group is used to manage the WireGuard "
"server instance. It handles configuration generation and service "
"lifecycle."
msgstr "``wireguard server`` 命令组用于管理 WireGuard 服务器实例。它负责处理配置生成和服务生命周期。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:7
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:10
msgid "server up"
msgstr "server up"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:12
msgid ""
"Generates the ``server_wg0.conf`` and ``server_compose.yml`` files based "
"on ``server_settings.py`` and then starts the Docker Compose service in "
"detached mode."
msgstr "基于 ``server_settings.py`` 生成 ``server_wg0.conf`` 和 ``server_compose.yml`` 文件，然后在分离模式下启动 Docker Compose 服务。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:14 ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:23
msgid "**Usage**::"
msgstr "**用法**::"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:19
msgid "server down"
msgstr "server down"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:21
msgid "Stops and removes the containers defined in ``server_compose.yml``."
msgstr "停止并移除 ``server_compose.yml`` 中定义的容器。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:28
msgid "Configuration (`server_settings.py`)"
msgstr "配置 (`server_settings.py`)"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:30
msgid ""
"This file contains all the necessary settings for the WireGuard server. "
"You must fill in the required values before starting the service."
msgstr "该文件包含 WireGuard 服务器所有必要的设置。在启动服务之前，您必须填写所需的值。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:76
msgid "**Parameter Details**:"
msgstr "**参数详解**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:78
msgid "**INTERFACE**:"
msgstr "**INTERFACE**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:79
msgid "``private_key``: **(Required)** The server's unique private key."
msgstr "``private_key``: **（必需）** 服务器的唯一私钥。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:80
msgid "``address``: The virtual IP address of the server inside the VPN."
msgstr "``address``: 服务器在 VPN 内部的虚拟 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:81
msgid ""
"``listen_port``: The public-facing UDP port for WireGuard traffic. Ensure"
" this port is open on your firewall."
msgstr "``listen_port``: 用于 WireGuard 流量的面向公网的 UDP 端口。请确保您的防火墙已放行此端口。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:82
msgid "**PEERS**:"
msgstr "**PEERS**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:83
msgid "``public_key``: **(Required)** The public key of an allowed client."
msgstr "``public_key``: **（必需）** 允许连接的客户端的公钥。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:84
msgid "``allowed_ips``: The internal VPN IP address assigned to this client."
msgstr "``allowed_ips``: 分配给此客户端的内部 VPN IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:85
msgid "**FORWARDS**:"
msgstr "**FORWARDS**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/server.rst:86
msgid ""
"A list of port forwarding rules. The server will use ``iptables`` to "
"forward traffic from a public ``external_port`` to a client's "
"``internal_ip:internal_port``. This is optional."
msgstr "端口转发规则列表。服务器将使用 ``iptables`` 将来自公网 ``external_port`` 的流量转发到客户端的 ``internal_ip:internal_port``。此为可选配置。"
